# Optional git hooks

## `commit-msg`

Blocks any commit message line containing `cursoragent@cursor.com` (Cursor agent `Co-authored-by` trailers).

Enable from the repository root:

```bash
git config core.hooksPath .githooks
```

To disable later:

```bash
git config --unset core.hooksPath
```

This is optional; the canonical policy for AI agents is in `.cursor/rules/git-no-cursor-coauthor.mdc`.
